    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "$g(x)=x\\sin(-x)+\\cos(-x)$. Decide whether $g(x)$ is odd, even, or neither.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Even.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}g(x)&=-x\\sin x+\\cos x\\\\g(-x)&=-(-x)\\sin(-x)+\\cos(-x)\\\\g(-x)&=-x\\sin x+\\cos x\\\\g(-x)&=g(x)\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore, $g$ is even.\n\nSketch this on Desmos, it looks really cool!",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
